==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*gʷʰer-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*žarъkъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|жа́ркий}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-жаркий.ogg}}

===Adjective===
{{ru-adj|жа́ркий|+c}}

# [[hot]], [[making|make]] one [[feel]] [[hot]] (such as of the surrounding [[air]] or the [[sun]])
#: {{uxi|ru|'''жа́ркий''' [[во́здух]]|'''hot''' air}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''жа́ркое''' [[со́лнце]]|the '''hot''' sun}}
# having a [[hot]] [[climate]], [[southern]], [[tropical]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''жа́ркие''' [[страна|стра́ны]]|countries '''with a hot climate'''}}
# [[fervent]], [[warm]], [[passionate]]

====Declension====
{{ru-decl-adj|жа́ркий|c*}}

====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|горя́чий}}

